flake: open the processor in Digital with flake-parts

nix run opens rv64_cpu.dig in Digital, and the development shell has
Digital, the RISC-V binutils of Nixpkgs, which make finds through AS and
OBJDUMP, Python, and reuse.

nix flake check lints the repository with reuse, checks the formatting
of the Nix, Markdown, shell, TOML, and YAML files, rebuilds the ROM
images from the programs and the control words and compares them with
the images in the repository and the ROMs in the circuits, and runs
every program on the processor in Digital, which must reach the result
that the program documents.
